id: SAVE5-3
package: fandhe-workshop-core
test: reload_after_control
target: crates/core/src/reload.rs
find:     state.run.generation = next;
replace:     state.run.generation = next; state.checkpoints.clear();
expect-fail: reload_right_after_restore_restores_the_restored_state
note: 再読み込みでチェックポイントの一覧を消す。復帰の直後の一覧が再読み込みの後に残らない
